// ReadPublications strictly reads every message a producing record publishes,
// the publishes message first. Its payload type is the record's payloadType
// when present, else the derivation from the message; a publications list
// adds the messages published beside it on the same channel, each typed by
// its own payloadType or the derivation. The list must name the publishes
